{
  "task.25C2CD55816664D4.title": "&fGroup Summons",
  "quest.465A950126ABF758.quest_desc": [
    "Have you ever gone caving and stumbled onto a random fully grown tree? That's most likely an &2Otherworld Grove&r.",
    "",
    "&aOtherworld Groves&r are overgrown caves filled with &2Otherworld Trees&r and walls made of &9Otherstone&r.",
    "",
    "&2Otherworld Trees&r appear as oak trees to the naked eye, but reveal their true form under the &bThird Eye&r effect.",
    "",
    "&aOtherworld Saplings&r can only be obtained by breaking &2Otherworld Leaves&r manually.",
  ],
  "quest.1A3C52B662D8237B.quest_subtitle": "Summoning Pentacle: Tier 6",
  "task.346A097A266F1BCD.title": "&fA Note For The Questline",
  "quest.0EBEF0B2D2F13C3D.quest_desc": [
    "&bPossession Rituals&r bind &bSpirits&r into living beings, giving the summoner a degree of control over the possessed being.",
    "",
    "As such, these &bRituals&r are used to obtain rare items without having to venture into dangerous places.",
  ],
  "quest.3BCB8667CCEBAE57.quest_desc": [
    "&eOccultism's&r upgradeable storage system allows you to store your items in a separate dimension of &9The Otherworld&r.",
    "",
    "The &aStorage Actuator Base&r is the first of two parts needed to access your storage dimension.",
    "",
    "This block functions very much like a big shulker box. This means that when breaking the &aDimensional Storage Actuator&r, your items will stay safe inside the block.",
  ],
  "quest.6E07405D08CCC2D4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"For the next tier of Chalks to upgrade your existing \", {\"text\": \"Pentacles\", \"color\": \"#55FFFF\"}, \", you'll need \", {\"text\": \"Lime Chalk\", \"color\": \"#E2FC97\"}, \", \", {\"text\": \"Light Gray Chalk\", \"color\": \"#C2C2C2\"}, \", and some skeleton skulls.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.4FD0504ADB98E0C0.quest_subtitle": "Binding Pentacle: Tier 2",
  "quest.633843210DE84A0D.quest_desc": [
    "&bWhite Chalk&r is considered a &bFoundation Chalk&r.",
    "",
    "&bFoundation Chalks&r are tiered chalks that can be used interchangeably with other colorless chalks, as long as they can summon the appropriate tier. They come in four different colors:",
    "",
    "- White: Tier 1",
    "[\"- \", {\"text\": \"Light Gray\", \"color\": \"#C6C6C6\"}, {\"text\": \": Tier 2\", \"color\": \"white\"}]",
    "[\"- \", {\"text\": \"Gray\", \"color\": \"#929292\"}, {\"text\": \": Tier 3\", \"color\": \"white\"}]",
    "[\"- \", {\"text\": \"Black\", \"color\": \"#000000\"}, {\"text\": \": Tier 4\", \"color\": \"white\"}]",
    "",
    "More advanced &bRituals&r will require a better &bFoundation Chalk&r.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"As an example, you can use \", {\"text\": \"Black Chalk\", \"color\": \"#000000\"}, \" in place of White, \", {\"text\": \"Light Gray\", \"color\": \"#C6C6C6\"}, \", or \", {\"text\": \"Gray\", \"color\": \"#929292\"}, \" glyphs for any \", {\"text\": \"Pentacle\", \"color\": \"#55FFFF\"}, \". However, White cannot be used in place of \", {\"text\": \"Light Gray\", \"color\": \"#C6C6C6\"}, \", \", {\"text\": \"Gray\", \"color\": \"#929292\"}, \", or \", {\"text\": \"Black Chalk\", \"color\": \"#000000\"}, \" glyphs.\"]",
  ],
  "task.3C308BEEE3895C69.title": "&bPentacle&r Complete",
  "quest.51D07B8762C46982.title": "&bBinding Rituals",
  "task.53A96A871A0DB011.title": "&bPentacle&r Complete",
  "quest.68A9006D2FE4A38D.title": "&aTier 1 Dimensional Storage Stabilizer",
  "quest.078CAC5AA9A2D84D.title": "&3Storage Access On-The-Go",
  "quest.10F792474C01A594.title": "&fWelcome to &eOccultism&r!",
  "quest.1F09A28387DA18A6.quest_desc": [
    "Items with unique properties (NBT Data), such as damaged or enchanted equipment will take up one item type for each variation.",
    "",
    "For example, two wooden swords with two different damage values will take up two item types.",
    "",
    "Other mods can access the storage controller just like a shulker box, but some mods may struggle to read stack sizes.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "&lLogistics:&r",
    "When inserting items, the &aStorage Actuator&r will maximize performance automatically, minimizing impact on game performance.",
    "",
    "When extracting items, however, it is recommended to use a &7Foliot Transporter&r, even if it only places the items inside a chest next to the &aStorage Actuator&r.",
    "",
    "This is because, when extracting a specific item from the &aStorage Actuator&r, most pipes will cycle through every single stored item one by one, massively impacting game performance, especially on servers.",
  ],
  "quest.38D3BE7AF6792B8D.quest_desc": [
    "Using &9Blue Chalk&r and &dWither Skeleton Skulls&r you are able to summon and bind &6Marids&r into powerful beings.",
    "",
    "Most &bPossession&r and &bFamiliar Rituals&r are optional, but you will still need to complete their &bPentacles&r to reach the &5End-Game&r.",
  ],
  "quest.0C24D8CD961D86B2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"With \", {\"text\": \"Gray\", \"color\": \"#929292\"}, \" and \", {\"text\": \"Orange\", \"color\": \"#FCA645\"}, {\"text\": \" Chalks\", \"color\": \"green\"}, \", you can now upgrade your \", {\"text\": \"Ophyx' Calling\", \"color\": \"dark_aqua\"}, \" to \", {\"text\": \"Kandar's Opened Conjure\", \"color\": \"#FF55FF\"}, \".\"]",
    "",
    "This &bRitual&r is only used to summon an &dUnbound Afrit&r. Killing it will grant you its essence, allowing you to make &cRed Chalk&r.",
    "",
    "Unfortunately, you might have to sacrifice ol' Bessy.",
    "",
    "This item is also needed to complete the &6FTB Pyramid&r.",
  ],
  "task.2E079C677B170563.title": "&fFoundation Chalks",
  "quest.68A9006D2FE4A38D.quest_desc": [
    "&aStorage Stabilizers&r increase the storage space in the &2Storage Actuator&r.",
    "",
    "Higher tier &aStorage Stabilizers&r provide a bigger storage increase for both items and item types.",
    "",
    "&aStorage Stabilizers&r can be placed up to five blocks away, facing the &2Dimensional Matrix&r texture. Check the &aDictionary of Spirits&r for the exact layout.",
    "",
    "Each &aTier 1 Dimensional Storage Stabilizer&r adds 512000 items, and 64 item types, up to four &aStabilizers&r.",
  ],
  "quest.0733AB66BFEB220E.quest_desc": [
    "Using &dSevira's Permanent Confinement&r, you can craft &0Black Chalk&r.",
    "",
    "This can be used to upgrade your existing &bPentacles&r, as well as being the highest tier &bFoundation Chalk&r.",
  ],
  "quest.0EBEF0B2D2F13C3D.title": "&bPossession Rituals",
  "task.4F725B8E1BB9B8D1.title": "&bBinding Rituals",
  "quest.42B887FC6D9FE211.title": "&fYour First &bRitual",
  "quest.38D3BE7AF6792B8D.title": "&6Xeovrenth Adjure",
  "quest.6137DE875E13EF72.title": "&bSummoning Rituals",
  "quest.4DB0A34E6C46B0B8.title": "&cSacrificial Rituals",
  "task.1D13D516425A8FDE.title": "&bPentacle&r Complete",
  "quest.1A3C52B662D8237B.title": "&6Fatma's Incentivized Attraction",
  "quest.6338A56F731A5F25.title": "&bFamiliar Rituals",
  "quest.349143B50076A759.quest_desc": [
    "Each &6Tier 4 Dimensional Storage Stabilizer&r adds 4096000 items, and 512 item types, up to four &aStabilizers&r.",
  ],
  "quest.3964E9A95D52B0FD.quest_desc": [
    "The next tier of &bSummoning Pentacle&r is &dTibira's Attraction&r.",
    "",
    "This &bRitual&r is only used to summon an &6Unbound Marid&r. Killing it will grant you its essence, allowing you to make &9Blue Chalk&r.",
  ],
  "quest.1CAA9A2F7F3EDAD3.quest_subtitle": "Chalk of Flesh",
  "quest.63516E977D8BC7C4.quest_desc": [
    "The &5Eldritch Chalice&r is an upgraded version of the &dIesnium Sacrificial Bowl&r, which will instantly perform any ritual.",
    "",
    "It also looks really cool.",
  ],
  "quest.6750DD01D865937D.title": "&5Stabilized Dimensional Storage Actuator",
  "quest.4A63B415FED7E777.title": "&6Uphyxes Inverted Tower",
  "quest.0D0892AD0DB44795.title": "&fSpirit Attuned Gem",
  "task.41685895FDFE2D3B.title": "&bPentacle&r Complete",
  "quest.047AA74F1CED211E.title": "&3Dimensional Storage",
  "task.438673D8562CCBA9.title": "Stones",
  "quest.76323B3FF4F17A2B.quest_desc": [
    "You'll need items from the &9Otherworld&r to progress further, and &2Spirit Fire&r does just that.",
    "",
    "Throwing a &aDemon's Dream Fruit&r on the ground and setting it on fire will produce &2Spirit Fire&r, which never burns out and does not harm entities.",
    "",
    "Throwing items into the &2Spirit Fire&r will convert them into their &9Otherworld&r equivalent.",
  ],
  "quest.1CD21F10064581B4.quest_desc": [
    "",
    "Each color draws pentacles the one below it cannot. The Dictionary of Spirits lists which ritual wants which chalk, so check there before you spend a full circle's worth.",
  ],
  "quest.5F0AAD028931A220.quest_desc": [
    "[ \"With \", {\"text\": \"Lime\", \"color\": \"#E2FC97\"}, \" and \", {\"text\": \"Light Gray\", \"color\": \"#C2C2C2\"}, \" chalks, you can now upgrade your \", {\"text\": \"Aviar's Circle\", \"color\": \"aqua\"}, \" to \", {\"text\": \"Ophyx' Calling\", \"color\": \"dark_aqua\"}, \" to clear the weather, skip the night, or summon a variety of \", {\"text\": \"Djinnis\", \"color\": \"dark_aqua\"}, \".\"]",
    "Most &bRituals&r using this &bPentacle&r are optional.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A New Trader is the &dWondering Trader&r, a wandering trader with unique occultic trades.",
    "",
    "With the &dThird Eye&r you can find them pretending to be a normal wandering trader. Don't let them fool you.",
  ],
  "quest.1DCCF9A58A557282.quest_desc": [
    "With &6Marid Essence&r, you can now craft &9Blue Chalk&r.",
    "",
    "This is used to upgrade your existing &bPentacles&r to the next tier.",
  ],
  "quest.43BF1E0CE33F8BB7.quest_subtitle": "Chalk of Evil",
  "quest.62BB8F93956480BA.quest_desc": [
    "&aBook of Bindings&r are used to summon different &bSpirit&r tiers, and can be acquired by tossing a book and quill into &2Spirit Fire&r.",
    "",
    "To identify a &bSpirit&r to summon, its name must be written in a &aBook of Binding&r and then combined with a &6Dictionary of Spirits&r, resulting in a &2Bound Book of Binding&r.",
    "",
    "&bSpirit&r names are only used as flair and do not impact the recipe. As long as you have the right &bSpirit Tier&r, your &aBound Book&r can be used.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "There are 4 different tiers of &bSpirits&r:",
    "",
    "- &7Foliot&r: Tier 1",
    "- &3Djinni&r: Tier 2",
    "- &dAfrit&r: Tier 3",
    "- &6Marid&r: Tier 4",
    "",
    "The &aBound Book&r that is required to complete a &bRitual&r will be based on the tier of the &bSpirit&r you are trying to summon, and the &bPentacle&r tier you use.",
  ],
  "quest.349143B50076A759.title": "&6Tier 4 Dimensional Storage Stabilizer",
  "task.34E4854C5D701F99.title": "&fDimensional Storage Actuator",
  "task.3F405FB146055F6D.title": "Sacrifices",
  "quest.43BF1E0CE33F8BB7.title": "{\"text\": \"Brown Chalk\", \"color\": \"#AA7B5A\"}",
  "quest.3830D82DFA731ABA.quest_desc": [
    "If we want to play with &cDemons&r, we'll need a way to summon them with rituals. To do this, we need &aChalk&r.",
    "",
    "&aChalk&r is used to draw glyphs for your &bRituals&r. You will come across many different colored &aChalks&r as you progress through &eOccultism&r.",
    "",
    "Your first one is &7Impure White Chalk&r, which can be thrown into &2Spirit Fire&r to purify it into &aWhite Chalk&r.",
    "",
    "&aChalk&r is pretty hard to scrub off of the ground, but you can use a &2Chalk Brush&r to get rid of any misplaced glyphs.",
  ],
  "quest.4B4DFB318CE36DAE.title": "&zRainbow&r \\&\\ &5Void&r Chalks",
  "task.373810705E9367E4.title": "&bPentacle&r Complete",
  "quest.3AF598F0517B7BA6.title": "&aRemote Network Access",
  "quest.0D0892AD0DB44795.quest_desc": [
    "&aSpirit Attuned Gems&r can be used in a variety of crafting recipes and &bRituals&r, but is most commonly used to make the &2Divination Rod&r and &dSpirit Attuned Crystals&r.",
    "",
    "To acquire a &aSpirit Attuned Gems&r, simply toss a diamond into &2Spirit Fire&r.",
    "",
    "Note: &dSpirit Attuned Crystals&r are great to use in your Enchanting setups!",
  ],
  "quest.6E07405D08CCC2D4.title": "[{\"text\": \"\", \"color\": \"#FFFFFF\"}, {\"text\": \"Lime\", \"color\": \"#E2FC97\"}, \" & \", {\"text\": \"Light Gray\", \"color\": \"#C2C2C2\"}, \" Chalks\"]",
  "quest.3FB2A1A98B36234F.quest_desc": [
    "The &5Trinity Gem&r is an upgraded version of the &cSoul Gem&r and is able to capture almost any mob.",
  ],
  "quest.081F9BFA0347582F.quest_desc": [
    "The next color of &aChalk&r requires you to get some &3Cursed Honey&r.",
    "",
    "To get this material, we'll need to use &3Ihagan's Enthrallment&r to summon a possessed bee.",
    "",
    "This will require a tier 2 &aPossession Pentacle&r.",
  ],
  "quest.0A63C6F9B76293DB.quest_desc": [
    "The &aDivination Rod&r helps you find nearby &2Otherworld&r materials.",
    "",
    "To do this, the &aDivination Rod&r must first be attuned to the normal world equivalent by Sneak + Right-clicking the corresponding block.",
    "",
    "Once attuned, you can hold down right click to use the &aDivination Rod&r until the animation in the gem finishes. This will highlight the closest corresponding block.",
    "",
    "To see a list of items you can attune to, check the next page!",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Andesite -> Otherstone",
    "Oak Wood -> Otherworld Log",
    "Oak Leaves -> Otherworld Leaves",
    "Netherrack -> Iesnium Ore",
    "",
    "Right-clicking the &aDivination Rod&r without holding after a successful search will show the last found target block again.",
    "",
    "The crystal changes between white and purple to indicate how close you are to the block found. White means nothing was found. The more purple you see, the closer you are to the block.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: Breaking &2Iesnium Ore&r with an ordinary pickaxe only drops netherrack. Use an &aIesnium Pickaxe&r, or an &2Infused Pickaxe&r with a &bFamiliar&r inside it. A freshly crafted &2Infused Pickaxe&r is empty, so right-click one of your &bFamiliars&r with it to capture one.",
  ],
  "quest.5D5D0878275558BC.quest_desc": [
    "",
    "Another rung, another set of pentacles opened. Keep a stack of the earlier colors; upgrading a circle does not retire the chalk underneath it.",
  ],
  "quest.4B4DFB318CE36DAE.quest_desc": [
    "&6Rainbow Chalk&r can replace any &bNon-foundation Chalk&r (white, gray, light gray, black).",
    "",
    "It also comes with extra features:",
    "",
    "- Using a &aSpirit Attuned Gem&r in the off-hand toggles the random color changes, or use any dye to set the glyph color.",
    "",
    "- Using this chalk on a glyph while crouching will erase the glyph, acting as a &aChalk Brush&r.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The &6Rainbow Chalk&r can also be used to make &5Void Chalk&r.",
    "",
    "&5Void Chalk&r is an upgraded version of the &6Rainbow Chalk&r that can replace any chalk including &bFoundation Chalk&r.",
  ],
  "quest.782A8F5006E367E0.title": "&fUsing Items In &bRituals",
  "quest.53B7A49C8138D3B0.title": "&cAbras' Open Commanding Conjure",
  "quest.4E90956E9A3ADAC9.title": "&aDemon's Dream Fruit",
  "quest.4CDCFE544B72E6C4.title": "&5Eldritch Ancient Miner",
  "quest.6338A56F731A5F25.quest_desc": [
    "&bFamiliar Rituals&r summon &bSpirits&r to inhabit an animal's body, allowing them to resist decay and provide buffs to the summoner.",
    "",
    "Some of these buffs can be acquired by binding the &bFamiliar&r to a &aFamiliar Ring&r and equipping it.",
    "",
    "Most &bFamiliars&r will behave like tamed animals, following the player unless instructed not to.",
  ],
  "quest.7E909792A1E7CFD1.quest_desc": [
    "With &cRed Chalk&r, you can upgrade your &dAbras' Open Conjure&r to the next tier: &5Abras' Conjure&r.",
    "",
    "That's right. We just closed it.",
    "",
    "This &bPentacle&r allows you to safely summon and bind &dAfrits&r, powerful &bFamiliars&r, and fully control the weather.",
    "",
    "Most &bRituals&r using this &bPentacle&r are optional.",
  ],
  "quest.4A63B415FED7E777.quest_subtitle": "Binding Pentacle: Tier 4",
  "quest.76323B3FF4F17A2B.title": "&cIt Burns!!!",
  "quest.081F9BFA0347582F.title": "&3Cursed Honey",
  "quest.10E3AB8F0B7B9F30.title": "&9Otherworld &rLog",
  "quest.4113BA0BADB486F0.quest_desc": [
    "Our new friend should make it easy for us to make &aCrushed Endstone&r, but before we continue, it's important to understand more about &bRituals&r and &bPentacles&r! ",
    "",
    "In short, a &bPentacle&r is a formation of glyphs, bowls, and stabilizers placed around the &aGolden Sacrificial Bowl&r.",
    "",
    "A &bRitual&r is the act of offering items to summon a &bSpirit&r from &9The Otherworld&r.",
    "",
    "There are 4 different types of &bPentacles&r, and each can be upgraded as you progress.",
    "",
    "This means that you only need four 19x19 areas to set up all 4 types of &bPentacles&r!",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\", {\"text\": \"Rituals\", \"color\": \"#55FFFF\"}, \" are mainly split into four categories: \", {\"text\": \"Binding\", \"color\": \"#FFFF55\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"51D07B8762C46982\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Go to Binding Quest\"}}, \", \", {\"text\": \"Possession\", \"color\": \"#FFFF55\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"0EBEF0B2D2F13C3D\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Go to Possession Quest\"}}, \", \", {\"text\": \"Familiar\", \"color\": \"#FFFF55\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"6338A56F731A5F25\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Go to Familiar Quest\"}}, \", and \", {\"text\": \"Summoning\", \"color\": \"#FFFF55\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"id\": \"ftbquests:link\", \"payload\": {\"quest_id\": \"6137DE875E13EF72\", \"page\": 1}, \"action\": \"custom\"}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Go to Summoning Quest\"}}, \".\"]",
    "",
    "Your &aAviar's Circle&r &bPentacle&r is considered a &bSummoning Pentacle&r.",
    "",
    "The next upgrade for it is &3Ophyx' Calling&r, which allows you to summon &bDjinni&r.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "When completing a &bRitual&r, a purple particle effect will show that the &bRitual&r is successful and in progress.",
    "",
    "If a &bRitual&r shows gray particles above the &6Golden Sacrificial Bowl&r, then additional requirements need to be fulfilled, such as item use or a &cliving sacrifice&r.",
  ],
  "task.2863432ECAE88DDF.title": "&fWild Summons",
  "quest.23B06AB674CC7193.quest_desc": [
    "[\"Upgrading \", {\"text\": \"Strigeor's Higher Binding\", \"color\": \"dark_aqua\"}, \" with \", {\"text\": \"Orange\", \"color\": \"#FCA645\"}, \" and \", {\"text\": \"Gray\", \"color\": \"#929292\"}, \" chalks, and \", {\"text\": \"Spirit Attuned Crystals\", \"color\": \"#FF55FF\"}, \" allows you to permanently bind the powerful \", {\"text\": \"Afrit\", \"color\": \"#FF55FF\"}, \" to an item.\"]",
    "",
    "Some &bBinding Rituals&r are optional, but you will need most of them if you want to reach &eOccultism &5End-Game.",
    "",
    "Click on the checkmark to progress the questline.",
  ],
  "quest.016E959A387A1E03.title": "{\"text\": \"Purple Chalk\", \"color\": \"#9D7AD0\"}",
  "quest.013375F170CE6A2F.quest_subtitle": "Possession Pentacle: Tier 2",
  "quest.0733AB66BFEB220E.title": "&fBlack Chalk",
  "quest.1F09A28387DA18A6.title": "&fNBT Tags \\&\\ Storage Logistics",
  "quest.10E3AB8F0B7B9F30.quest_subtitle": "Same Same, But Different",
  "task.79182D262D72B84F.title": "&fTrial Summons",
  "quest.016E959A387A1E03.quest_subtitle": "Chalk of Infusion",
  "quest.7E909792A1E7CFD1.title": "&dAbras' Conjure",
  "quest.2F0C6EA5380AA661.quest_desc": [
    "With &cAfrit Essence&r, you can create the next tier of Chalk: &cRed Chalk&r.",
  ],
  "task.5BE8C72BDBCC78CE.title": "&bFamiliar Rituals",
  "quest.0C24D8CD961D86B2.title": "&cKandar's Opened Conjure",
  "quest.0A63C6F9B76293DB.quest_subtitle": "The Intended Occultism Experience",
  "quest.4C9473D2E4149656.quest_subtitle": "The Final Pentacle",
  "quest.078CAC5AA9A2D84D.quest_desc": [
    "Sneak + Right-click a &aDimensional Storage Actuator&r with a &3Storage Accessor&r to link them, allowing you to access your items from anywhere in the world, even across dimensions.",
  ],
  "quest.2F0C6EA5380AA661.title": "&cRed Chalk",
  "quest.4113BA0BADB486F0.title": "&fMore About &bRituals \\&\\ Pentacles",
  "quest.013375F170CE6A2F.title": "&3Ihagan's Enthrallment",
  "quest.0017F48E23512C75.quest_desc": [
    "[\"You can now upgrade your existing \", {\"text\": \"Pentacles\", \"color\": \"#55FFFF\"}, \" with \", {\"text\": \"Orange\", \"color\": \"#FCA645\"}, \" and \", {\"text\": \"Gray\", \"color\": \"#929292\"}, {\"text\": \" Chalks\", \"color\": \"green\"}, \", and \", {\"text\": \"Spirit Attuned Crystals\", \"color\": \"#FF55FF\"}, \".\"]",
  ],
  "quest.28493A960B770451.quest_desc": [
    "Each &dTier 3 Dimensional Storage Stabilizer&r adds 2048000 items, and 256 item types, up to four &aStabilizers&r.",
  ],
  "quest.32E0A399AFBE3099.quest_desc": [
    "To summon higher tier &bSpirits&r, we're going to need better chalk.",
    "",
    "This requires a new type of &bPentacle&r called &aEziveus' Spectral Compulsion&r. Make sure to use the guidebook to help you create it!",
    "",
    "This is the basic starting point for &bBinding Rituals&r. It binds a &7Foliot&r to your items, enhancing their functionality.",
    "",
    "Some &bBinding Rituals&r are optional, but you will need most of them if you want to reach &eOccultism's&r &5End-Game&r.",
  ],
  "quest.1DCCF9A58A557282.title": "&9Blue Chalk",
  "quest.1CD21F10064581B4.title": "&aGreen Chalk",
  "quest.28493A960B770451.title": "&dTier 3 Dimensional Storage Stabilizer",
  "quest.4A63B415FED7E777.quest_desc": [
    "&6Uphyxes Inverted Tower&r combines the powers of &9Blue Chalk&r and &dWither Skeleton Skulls&r, allowing you to summon and bind Marids into extremely powerful items.",
    "",
    "Some &bBinding Rituals&r are optional, but you will need most of them if you want to reach &eOccultism &5End-Game.",
  ],
  "quest.782A8F5006E367E0.quest_desc": [
    "Some &bRituals&r require the use of certain items to be performed.",
    "",
    "Use the item within 16 blocks of the &6Golden Sacrificial Bowl&r to proceed the &bRitual&r.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: Before using the item, start the &bRitual&r. Gray particles indicate that the &bRitual&r is ready for the item use.",
  ],
  "quest.3964E9A95D52B0FD.quest_subtitle": "Summoning Pentacle: Tier 5",
  "quest.42B887FC6D9FE211.quest_subtitle": "Summoning Pentacle: Tier 1",
  "quest.10E8E47BEFCA8F97.quest_subtitle": "Contact Wild Spirits Pentacle",
  "quest.047AA74F1CED211E.quest_desc": [
    "Place down the &aDimensional Storage Actuator&r to begin storing your items.",
    "",
    "Without &2Stabilizers&r, the &aDimensional Storage Actuator&r can hold 256000 items with 128 item types.",
  ],
  "quest.53B7A49C8138D3B0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"Using \", {\"text\": \"Gray\", \"color\": \"#929292\"}, \" and \", {\"text\": \"Orange\", \"color\": \"#FCA645\"}, \" chalks, and \", {\"text\": \"Spirit Attune Crystals\", \"color\": \"#FF55FF\"}, \", you can now control an \", {\"text\": \"Afrit\", \"color\": \"#FF55FF\"}, \" to possess a zombified piglin, dropping \", {\"text\": \"Demonic Meat\", \"color\": \"#55FF55\"}, \" upon its death.\"]",
  ],
  "quest.38D3BE7AF6792B8D.quest_subtitle": "Possession Pentacle: Tier 5",
  "task.45E409BCABAACDB1.title": "&aOtherworld Groves",
  "task.7143B1EFAB0A1582.title": "&fHorde Summons",
  "quest.32E0A399AFBE3099.quest_subtitle": "Binding Pentacle: Tier 1",
  "quest.5F0AAD028931A220.title": "&3Ophyx' Calling",
  "quest.016E959A387A1E03.quest_desc": [
    "[\"Crushing endstone allows you to craft \", {\"text\": \"Purple Chalk\", \"color\": \"#9D7AD0\"}, \", which is the next tier of \", {\"text\": \"Chalk\", \"color\": \"green\"}, \" we'll need to perform better \", {\"text\": \"Rituals\", \"color\": \"aqua\"}, \".\"]",
  ],
  "quest.504EEAA75990C78C.quest_desc": [
    "To get &bCyan Chalk&r, you'll need a &6Marid Crusher&r to crush up &dEcho Shards&r for you.",
    "",
    "&5Eldritch Gods&r need very specific chalk to commune with them.",
    "",
    "&7&oThey might be colorblind.",
  ],
  "quest.0C24D8CD961D86B2.quest_subtitle": "Summoning Pentacle: Tier 3",
  "quest.0017F48E23512C75.title": "[{\"text\": \"\", \"color\": \"#FFFFFF\"}, {\"text\": \"Orange\", \"color\": \"#FCA645\"}, \" & \", {\"text\": \"Gray\", \"color\": \"#929292\"}, \" Chalks\"]",
  "quest.3AF598F0517B7BA6.quest_desc": [
    "The &aStable Wormhole&r allows access to a Dimensional Storage from a remote destination.",
    "",
    "Shift-click the &2Dimensional Storage Actuator&r to link it, then place the &aStable Wormhole&r in the world to use as a remote access point.",
  ],
  "quest.44E044BA9C152631.quest_desc": [
    "In some quests, you'll notice tasks that have &aoptional&r attached to them.",
    "",
    "Most of the time, this is done so you can click them to see the recipe for certain rituals!",
    "",
    "Keep an eye out for what is required as lots of quests have optional tasks to complete.",
  ],
  "task.183FEFA2AEF46058.title": "Observe &aSpirit Fire",
  "quest.4C9473D2E4149656.quest_desc": [
    "&6Ronaza's Contact&r is the most complex and advanced &bPentacle&r, combining all human knowledge of &9The Otherworld&r to allow communication with the &5Eldritch Gods&r.",
    "",
    "Using this &bPentacle&r, you can craft the strongest items in &eOccultism&r.",
  ],
  "quest.7E909792A1E7CFD1.quest_subtitle": "Summoning Pentacle: Tier 4",
  "quest.465A950126ABF758.title": "&aOtherworld Groves",
  "task.0AF26E34A4343D1E.title": "Burnt Stones",
  "quest.44E044BA9C152631.title": "&aSome Notes For This Questline",
  "quest.1CAA9A2F7F3EDAD3.quest_desc": [
    "",
    "The meat is the awkward part, and it comes from the things you summon rather than anything you farm. Plan the hunt before you plan the circle.",
  ],
  "quest.504EEAA75990C78C.title": "{\"text\": \"Cyan Chalk\", \"color\": \"#3DADAD\"}",
  "task.76A6B2D6E28D494F.title": "&fItem Summons",
  "task.34F38A214F5DEFC3.title": "&bSummoning Rituals",
  "quest.23B06AB674CC7193.quest_subtitle": "Binding Pentacle: Tier 3",
  "quest.0A63C6F9B76293DB.title": "&fDivination Rod",
  "quest.4F7B94DCD4B52CE4.quest_subtitle": "Possession Pentacle: Tier 1",
  "quest.51D07B8762C46982.quest_desc": [
    "&bBinding Rituals&r channel &bSpirits&r into items, imbuing them with powers dedicated to a single purpose.",
    "",
    "The starting &bPentacle&r for this type of &bRitual&r is &aEziveus' Spectral Compulsion&r.",
    "",
    "These items can serve as simple enhancements or perform complex functions to assist the player.",
  ],
  "quest.10E8E47BEFCA8F97.quest_desc": [
    "&dOsorin's Unbound Calling&r is used to contact a variety of wild &bSpirits&r for many purposes.",
    "",
    "There are a LOT of summons, so you can simply click the checkmark to progress the questline.",
  ],
  "quest.4F7B94DCD4B52CE4.title": "&aHedyrin's Lure",
  "quest.65EB766D0445C1A6.title": "&3Tier 2 Dimensional Storage Stabilizer",
  "quest.62BB8F93956480BA.title": "&bSpirits",
  "quest.4CDCFE544B72E6C4.quest_desc": [
    "The &5Eldritch Ancient Miner&r harvests entire blocks of raw ore at once.",
    "",
    "Compressing the &6Master Marid Miner&r has given you an extremely powerful and efficient miner.",
  ],
  "quest.4FD0504ADB98E0C0.title": "&3Strigeor's Higher Binding",
  "quest.4DB0A34E6C46B0B8.quest_desc": [
    "Some &bRituals&r require the &cSacrifice&r of a living being to provide the necessary energy to summon the &bSpirit&r.",
    "",
    "To perform a &cSacrifice&r, kill an animal within 8 blocks of the &6Golden Sacrificial Bowl&r.",
    "",
    "Only kills by players count as a &cSacrifice&r.",
  ],
  "quest.337838FB759E4377.title": "{\"text\": \"Magenta Chalk\", \"color\": \"#D17CC9\"}",
  "quest.4C9473D2E4149656.title": "&6Ronaza's Contact",
  "quest.53B7A49C8138D3B0.quest_subtitle": "Possession Pentacle: Tier 3",
  "quest.3964E9A95D52B0FD.title": "&dTibira's Attraction",
  "task.5A4A1F326C2F75BC.title": "&bPentacle&r Complete",
  "quest.43BF1E0CE33F8BB7.quest_desc": [
    "If we want to commune with the &5Eldritch Gods&r, we need the right colors of &aChalk&r.",
    "",
    "[\"Using \", {\"text\": \"Xeovrenth Adjure\", \"color\": \"#FFAA00\"}, \", \", {\"text\": \"Cruelty Essence\", \"color\": \"#FF5555\"}, \" can be used to craft \", {\"text\": \"Brown Chalk\", \"color\": \"#AA7B5A\"}, \".\"]",
  ],
  "quest.50F2EDF92D289869.title": "&9Otherstone",
  "quest.3BCB8667CCEBAE57.title": "&aStorage Actuator Base",
  "task.67A22BBA4C91522B.title": "Item Use",
  "quest.6750DD01D865937D.quest_desc": [
    "The &5Stabilized Dimensional Storage Actuator&r is not affected by &aStorage Stabilizers&r, but comes prebuilt with a &6Tier 4 Dimensional Storage Stabilizer&r.",
  ],
  "quest.4F7B94DCD4B52CE4.quest_desc": [
    "Using &aYellow Chalk&r, you can attract a &7Foliot&r to possess a nearby creature.",
    "",
    "Most &bPossession&r and &bFamiliar Rituals&r are optional, but you will need to complete their &bPentacles&r to reach the &5End-Game&r.",
    "",
    "Simply click on the checkmark to progress the questline.",
  ],
  "quest.10E3AB8F0B7B9F30.quest_desc": [
    "Throwing a regular &2Oak Sapling&r into &dSpirit Fire&r will convert it into an &aOak Sapling&r from the &9Otherworld&r.",
    "",
    "When planted and grown, this tree will look like a regular sapling. Those under the effects of the &bThird Eye&r can see what it really is!",
    "",
    "Chopping this tree down while under the effects of the Third Eye should drop you &9Otherworld Logs&r, which can be used in crafting recipes or rituals.",
    "",
    "Throwing the logs into &dSpirit Fire&r will give you &9Otherworld Ashes&r, a key component used to craft &aWhite Chalk&r.",
  ],
  "quest.3FB2A1A98B36234F.title": "&5Trinity Gem",
  "quest.633843210DE84A0D.title": "&fFoundation Chalks",
  "quest.0733AB66BFEB220E.quest_subtitle": "Perfected Foundation",
  "quest.4FD0504ADB98E0C0.quest_desc": [
    "By upgrading your &aEziveus' Spectral Compulsion&r, you can permanently bind a &3Djinni&r into an item.",
    "",
    "Some &bBinding Rituals&r are optional, but you will need most of them if you want to reach &eOccultism &5End-Game.",
    "",
    "Click on the checkmark to progress the questline.",
  ],
  "quest.5D5D0878275558BC.quest_subtitle": "Chalk of Ice",
  "quest.5F0AAD028931A220.quest_subtitle": "Summoning Pentacle: Tier 2",
  "quest.3830D82DFA731ABA.title": "&fBasic Chalks",
  "task.2657647D4CF31BBA.title": "Candles",
  "quest.1CD21F10064581B4.quest_subtitle": "Chalk of Nature",
  "task.553BD544A0125D67.title": "&bPentacle&r Complete",
  "quest.013375F170CE6A2F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"Using \", {\"text\": \"Lime\", \"color\": \"#E2FC97\"}, \" and \", {\"text\": \"Light Gray\", \"color\": \"#D6D6D6\"}, {\"text\": \" Chalks\", \"color\": \"green\"}, \", you can now attract a \", {\"text\": \"Djinni\", \"color\": \"dark_aqua\"}, \", allowing possession and summoning of stronger creatures.\"]",
    "",
    "Most &bPossession&r and &bFamiliar Rituals&r are optional, but you will still need to complete their &bPentacles&r to reach the &5End-Game&r.",
    "",
    "Simply click on the checkmark to progress the questline.",
  ],
  "quest.42B887FC6D9FE211.quest_desc": [
    "For our first &bRitual&r, we're going to summon a &7Foliot Crusher&r using the &aAviar's Circle Pentacle&r.",
    "",
    "The easiest way to do this is to navigate to the &bPentacles&r tab in your guidebook, then find &aAviar's Circle&r. On the right side, you should see a render of it with an eye icon in the bottom right.",
    "",
    "Clicking this will allow you to place a &bhologram&r to help you create the &bPentacle&r!",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Once you've drawn and completed the layout of the &bPentacle&r, you can place down &a4 Sacrificial Bowls&r anywhere within 8 blocks of the &6Golden Sacrificial Bowl&r.",
    "",
    "You might notice that most &bPentacles&r have the perfect spot for these!",
    "",
    "Next, you'll place down the items needed in the &aSacrificial Bowls&r, then place in the &7Book of Binding: Foliot (Bound)&r into the center &6Golden Sacrificial Bowl&r.",
    "",
    "Once all items are in place, you can right click the &6Golden Sacrificial Bowl&r and start the &bRitual&r!",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The items inside the bowls will be consumed until there are none left, at which point the &7Foliot Crusher&r will appear next to the &6Golden Sacrificial Bowl&r.",
    "",
    "Like all other &bCrushers&r, the &7Foliot Crusher&r will grind down items into dust, providing 2x the output.",
    "",
    "The &7Foliot Crusher&r is also needed to create the next color of &aChalk&r we'll need!",
  ],
  "quest.4E90956E9A3ADAC9.quest_desc": [
    "Once you've planted a few &2Demon's Dream Seeds&r, you can harvest them to acquire &aDemon's Dream Fruit&r.",
    "",
    "Consuming &aDemon's Dream Fruit&r gives you the effect of the &bThird Eye&r, allowing you to interact with &9The Otherworld&r and granting you knowledge of things not known to mere mortals.",
    "",
    "For now, you can only obtain this effect by eating a &aDemon's Dream Fruit&r, but this will change as you deepen your knowledge of the occult.",
  ],
  "quest.32E0A399AFBE3099.title": "&aThe Quest For More Chalk",
  "quest.50F2EDF92D289869.quest_desc": [
    "&aOtherstone&r can be acquired by tossing andesite into &2Spiritfire&r. Diorite thrown in the same way gives &aOtherrock&r, and either one counts here.",
    "",
    "Smelting &aOtherstone&r gives &2Polished Otherstone&r. Smelting that gives &aBurnt Otherstone&r, used to craft &2White Chalk&r. &aOtherrock&r takes the same two smelts to become &2Burnt Otherrock&r, which works in the same chalk recipe.",
  ],
  "task.6B0602266368826B.title": "&bPossession Rituals",
  "quest.5D5D0878275558BC.title": "{\"text\": \"Light Blue Chalk\", \"color\": \"#A6CAFC\"}",
  "task.45CC5A8334951331.title": "I have read and agreed to the Terms and Conditions",
  "quest.337838FB759E4377.quest_desc": [
    "I'm starting to think the &5Eldritch Gods&r might have had a hand in creating everything.",
    "",
    "[\"To create \", {\"text\": \"Magenta Chalk\", \"color\": \"#D17CC9\"}, \", you will need \", {\"text\": \"Dragonyst Dust\", \"color\": \"#FF55FF\"}, \".\"]",
    "",
    "This can only be acquired by using the &6Uphyxes Inverted Tower &bPentacle&r.",
  ],
  "quest.3031334952FA6DCC.quest_desc": [
    "&bRituals&r will require more than just some symbols drawn on the ground!",
    "",
    "Each &bRitual&r will need a different amount of &aSacrificial Bowls&r, which are used to place items that will be sacrificed.",
    "",
    "The &6Golden Ritual Bowl&r is the centerpiece of the &bRitual Pentacle&r. This bowl will hold the key item, which is usually a &dBound Book&r. An &6Iesnium Ritual Bowl&r or a dark version of either one does the same job.",
    "",
    "For the regular &aSacrificial Bowls&r, the exact placement does not matter as long as they are within 8 blocks of the &6Golden Ritual Bowl&r. Copper, Silver and Dark &aSacrificial Bowls&r work the same as the plain one.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "What type of &aRitual&r is it if it doesn't require some &2Candles&r! Any vanilla candle will do.",
    "",
    "If you want to get special with it, you can also make &aLarge Candles&r using &2Tallow&r.",
    "",
    "To get &aTallow&r, you will need to kill large animals with a &2Butcher Knife&r.",
    "",
    "Large animals include Cows, Horses, Llamas, Pigs, and Sheep.",
  ],
  "quest.3031334952FA6DCC.title": "&aPreparing The &bRitual",
  "quest.1DCCF9A58A557282.quest_subtitle": "Chalk of Seven Seas",
  "quest.10F792474C01A594.quest_desc": [
    "&eOccultism&r is a magic mod focused around summoning &bSpirits&r and using their powers and skills to your advantage.",
    "",
    "To get started, break some grass to find &aDemon's Dream Seeds&r.",
    "",
    "The &6Dictionary of Spirits&r is the ultimate guidebook for the mod. It's also needed for certain recipes, and can be used to create holograms to help you build out &bRituals&r!",
    "",
    "[\"\", \"Every ritual you finish also levels your \", {\"text\": \"Magic skill tree\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"action\": \"custom\", \"id\": \"ftbquests:docs\", \"payload\": {\"location\": \"guideme,ftb:skills,ftb:magic.md\"}}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open the Skill Trees guide\"}}, \".\"]",
  ],
  "quest.3830D82DFA731ABA.quest_subtitle": "Chalk of Foundation",
  "quest.1A3C52B662D8237B.quest_desc": [
    "With the power of &9Blue Chalk&r, you are capable of drawing &6Fatma's Incentivized Attraction&r to summon and bind Marids to your will.",
  ],
  "quest.504EEAA75990C78C.quest_subtitle": "Chalk of Ancients",
  "quest.337838FB759E4377.quest_subtitle": "Chalk of Draconic Energy",
  "quest.6137DE875E13EF72.quest_desc": [
    "&bSummoning Rituals&r force &bSpirits&r to enter this world in a chosen shape, setting them to a specific task.",
    "",
    "You've already made the first tier of &bSummoning Pentacle&r: &aAviar's Circle&r.",
    "",
    "These tasks can range from item manipulation and trading, to tireless helpers for manual labor.",
  ],
  "quest.10E8E47BEFCA8F97.title": "&dOsorin's Unbound Calling",
  "task.6A2D276566E902AD.title": "&bPentacle&r Complete",
  "quest.2F0C6EA5380AA661.quest_subtitle": "Chalk of Control",
  "quest.1CAA9A2F7F3EDAD3.title": "{\"text\": \"Pink Chalk\", \"color\": \"#FCB1D0\"}",
  "quest.63516E977D8BC7C4.title": "&5Eldritch Chalice",
  "quest.65EB766D0445C1A6.quest_desc": [
    "It is safe to destroy a &aStorage Stabilizer&r to upgrade it. The items in the &aStorage Actuator&r won't be lost or dropped, but you won't be able to add new items until it has free slots again.",
    "",
    "Each &3Tier 2 Dimensional Storage Stabilizer&r adds 1024000 items, and 128 item types, up to four &aStabilizers&r.",
  ],
  "task.63CCD5B192C043E9.title": "&eObserve&r: &7Foliot Crusher Demon",
  "task.72D916898EED9BF4.title": "&bPentacle&r Complete",
  "quest.23B06AB674CC7193.title": "&dSevira's Permanent Confinement",
}